== Overview ==

The '''Laser Scientist Toilet''' is an enemy added in [[Episode 70 Part 3 Update]]. This is a faster version of the [[Scientist Toilet]] with less health. This enemy has four lasers it can use to stun units.

This enemy only can spawn on endless mode and nightmare mode. He has a max health of 2 mil on wave 43 endless

== Appearance ==
Laser Scientist Toilet is a Large/Giant sized toilet with 4 lasers cannon and a jetpack. (He has really long lasers)

He appears with his toilet bowl on the ground but in the series he doesn't well in series he does but in the series, he is floating a couple foot off the ground. (estimate) 

== Waves ==
Wave 43 - Endless Mode

Wave 48 - Endless Mode

Wave 38 - Nightmare Mode

== Abilities ==
*Laser Shoot: shoots lasers that stuns units.

== Strategy ==
*You should use high DPS units such as the Hyper Upgraded Titan Speaker man to defeat this enemy.
*Units such as the Speaker Repair Drone can be used to unstun units stunned by the Laser Scientist Toilet.
*The Healer TV Woman is immune to stuns, making it much easier to defeat this enemy with it.
*The Shield Cameraman will make the Laser Scientist Toilet take damage every time it tries to stun the unit.
== Trivia ==
*This unit is based on the [https://skibidi-toilet.fandom.com/wiki/Chief_Scientist_Skibidi_Toilet#Quad-Laser_Scientist_Skibidi_Toilet_Mech Quad-Laser Chief Scientist Skibidi Toilet Mech] from the skibidi toilet series by Dafuqboom and he is seen in episode 70 part 3.
*In the series he is the small scientist toilet inside a mech.
*This is the second mech small scientist toilet has had.
